esolver trust. Provisional children dispatch only their creation result, holding all other duties until exact confirmation.\n\nI found no further correction in this changed-byte assessment. That is internal planning evidence, not an independent verdict or detailed adoption. Current source/runtime/provider capacity is unproved by this reading. Numeric final-item/guard/read/settlement budgets remain R4's reviewed obligation; R3 must agree on provisional/founding fences and actual unknown duties; R2 must agree on exact executable forms and browser states. Preserve all originalR1 full replay, source retention, interruption, public/manual/browser and retarget/removal scope. Revision5 needs a fresh ordinary independent review at its actual head, with complete original conditions, all3 subjects and current relevant news; the old causally stale verdict is history, not approval for the new bytes. Sprint filing/release remains with its coordinator; this assessment does not lift that hold, merge, commission source or add a fixed Jam gate.","body":{"head":"1ebf4a76e53e85fa9cc0a051add607c94772d982","scope":"R1 revision5 complete changed-byte planning assessment; independent review owed"}}